=== Text #1 ===
> [Dr] Harry D. Vildibill[ was] born in Tampa FL and raised in Brandon[,] FL. He attended Vanderbilt University and University of South Carolina, School of Medicine. He completed his general surgery residency at Mayo Graduate School of Medicine, Mayo Clinic, Rochester[,] MN. Dr Vilidbill has been in practice since 1998. Dr Vildibill[ is] married with 2 children.
Please visit our Surgeries page to see[ a list] of just some of the surgeries we perform.[][]

